句是周末打算？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I go to the cinema yesterday."},{"key":"B","text":"I going cinema."},{"key":"C","text":"I will go to the cinema on Saturday."},{"key":"D","text":"I went to the cinema yesterday only."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"will … on Saturday。","verify":"\"I will go to the cinema on Saturday.\""},{"id":"cne_p255_q4","topicId":"cne_p255","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Tom will go to the museum. Amy will stay at home. 谁打算去博物馆？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"谁都不去"},{"key":"B","text":"汤姆"},{"key":"C","text":"艾米"},{"key":"D","text":"两人都去"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Tom will go to the museum。","verify":"\"汤姆\""},{"id":"cne_p256_q1","topicId":"cne_p256","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问「你周末将做什么？」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What will you do this weekend?"},{"key":"B","text":"What will you did this weekend?"},{"key":"C","text":"What do you did this weekend?"},{"key":"D","text":"What you will do?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"What will you do …","verify":"\"What will you do this weekend?\""},{"id":"cne_p256_q2","topicId":"cne_p256","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Let's go to the park! 这句是在？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"禁止去公园"},{"key":"B","text":"询问价格"},{"key":"C","text":"说明昨天去了"},{"key":"D","text":"提议去公园"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Let's 表提议。","verify":"\"提议去公园\""},{"id":"cne_p256_q3","topicId":"cne_p256","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"—What will you do on Sunday? —____.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I am books."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, I am Sunday."},{"key":"C","text":"I will read books."},{"key":"D","text":"I read books yesterday only."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"用 will 回答打算。","verify":"\"I will read books.\""},{"id":"cne_p256_q4","topicId":"cne_p256","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读对话：—Let's visit the museum! —Great! I will take a camera. 他们同意做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"取消计划"},{"key":"B","text":"参观博物馆"},{"key":"C","text":"只在家睡觉"},{"key":"D","text":"去买菜"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Let's visit the museum，对方说 Great。","verify":"\"参观博物馆\""},{"id":"cne_p257_q1","topicId":"cne_p257","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：On Saturday we will have a picnic. 星期六计划做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"野餐"},{"key":"B","text":"看电影"},{"key":"C","text":"睡觉"},{"key":"D","text":"考试"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"have a picnic。","verify":"\"野餐\""},{"id":"cne_p257_q2","topicId":"cne_p257","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Sunday: visit the museum. 星期天去哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"电影院"},{"key":"B","text":"农场"},{"key":"C","text":"医院"},{"key":"D","text":"博物馆"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"visit the museum。","verify":"\"博物馆\""},{"id":"cne_p257_q3","topicId":"cne_p257","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：My great weekend plan: cinema on Saturday, park on Sunday. 哪一句一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"周六去公园。"},{"key":"B","text":"没有计划。"},{"key":"C","text":"周日去公园。"},{"key":"D","text":"周日去电影院。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"park on Sunday。","verify":"\"周日去公园。\""},{"id":"cne_p257_q4","topicId":"cne_p257","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：We will meet at 9:00. We will go to the cinema. Don't be late! 集合几点？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"晚上"},{"key":"B","text":"9 点"},{"key":"C","text":"电影院开门时间未写"},{"key":"D","text":"8 点"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"meet at 9:00。","verify":"\"9 点\""}]
